-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 31.8.94 (ארגון המורים): the wage agreement between the
-- State, the local authorities and the three large cities, and ארגון
-- המורים בבתי הספר העל-יסודיים, בסמינרים ובמכללות, that carries out the
-- employers' undertaking of §34.ג of the collective agreement of 11.5.93:
-- the value of the supplements the engineers were given. The wage
-- supplement on the combined salary (9.5% to 34%, the last subject to the
-- erosion check of January 1996) and תוספת 1993 inside the combined
-- salary (§§2–3); the school in-service sections of 1993 cancelled (§4);
-- 2% for accrual-pension rights (§5); "תגבור הוראה", 106 shekels (§6);
-- havraa days (§7); the jubilee grant (§8); the retired principals'
-- management allowance (§9); quotas of intermediate allowances, hours and
-- in-service grants and the in-service budget (§§10–12, 15–16); the M.A.
-- and Ph.D. supplement (§13); the management and supervision allowances
-- (§14); the colleges committee (§17); budgetary pensioners (§18); saving
-- in a sabbatical (§19); protection against inflation (§20); special
-- personal contracts (§21); whom it covers, its period, the differences,
-- the sabbatical, Histadrut HaMorim's agreement, the exhaustion of claims
-- and industrial peace (§§22–28); and two letters of 1.9.1994.
--
-- The agreement of 12.9.95 (l4/agreements/oz-latmura/1995-09-12_oz-latmura_special-agreement-hashlama.l4)
-- adds sections to it and cancels §3; the agreement of 8.9.98 carries on
-- its §§5 and 21; the Oz LaTmura agreement of 14.8.2011 changes its §8
-- (oz-founding-42) and §21 (oz-founding-53). It speaks to no pay item of
-- l4/lib/vocabulary.l4 and is not in oz-latmura-root.l4.
--
-- The collective agreement of 11.5.93 that this one amends and extends,
-- with its erosion check (§8), is outside the corpus; so are the
-- engineers' agreement of 29.4.94 and the agreement of 88/90.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — תוספות שכר לעובדי ההוראה (31.8.1994)`

DECLARE `1994 Oz agreement action` IS ONE OF
    `allocate half a percent of the pension salary a year for accrual-pension rights`
    `set the arrangement for the in-service allowances of 5754`
    `finish the split-allowance committee's work`
    `apply the split-allowance committee's recommendations from 1.9.94`
    `transfer the in-service training sums to the organisations`
    `publish the colleges committee's conclusions`
    `carry out the colleges committee's conclusions`
    `pay the 1993 retirees their difference`
    `transfer the employers' share to the shortened fund`
    `choose the management allowance's base`
    `draft the uniform special contract`
    `hand the special contract's text to every owner`
    `have the owners' special-contract teachers sign the uniform text`
    `pass the special contract's text to the organisation`
    `send the organisation the names of the teachers on special contracts`
    `pass the organisation data on the special contracts' success`
    `act to apply the 1994 agreement to the owners' teaching employees`
    `pay the differences of the 1994 agreement`
    `strike or lock out over a matter the 1994 agreement settled`

`why the collective agreement of 11.5.93 is not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "ההסכם הקיבוצי בין ארגון המורים לבין המעסיקים מיום 11.5.93"

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The registration stamp (15.2.96, no. 7076/94); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 The first party, the State, and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 The Centre of Local Government, for every local authority save the three large cities; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 The three large cities and who represents them; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The employers' short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 "Side A"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 The second party, the secondary teachers' organisation, and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 The organisation's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 "Side B"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 A recital: under §34.ג of the agreement of 11.5.93 the employers undertook the framework supplement, or failing one the engineers' supplements.
-- akn:preamble/p13 A recital: the parties negotiated the teachers' terms and changes to the agreement of 11.5.93, to carry out that undertaking.
-- akn:preamble/p14 The same recital again, naming the post-primary schools, seminars and colleges; no rule of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p15 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

-- ¶3: the day of signing, written by hand.
@ref akn:preamble/p3
`the 1994 Oz agreement was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 1994

§§ `1 מבוא`

@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1/p1
`the 1994 Oz agreement's preamble and annexes are part of it` MEANS TRUE

§§ `2 תוספות שכר`

-- ¶1, 2.1–2.4: the teaching employees are paid a wage supplement of the
-- combined salary, at a rate that stands, from its day (convention
-- dates.start), at 9.5% from 1.1.94, 12.5% from 1.7.94, 20% from 1.1.95 and
-- 24% from 1.7.95: each "תוגדל ... ותעמוד על" is the whole rate from its
-- day, not an addition to the one before. "השכר המשולב" is the combined
-- salary as it was to be paid on 1.1.94, תוספת 1993 included (§3), as
-- updated from time to time.
@ref akn:art_2 akn:art_2/p1 akn:art_2__para_2-1 akn:art_2__para_2-2 akn:art_2__para_2-3 akn:art_2__para_2-4
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1994 Oz supplement rate before 1996 on` d IS
    BRANCH
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 1995) THEN 24%
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1995) THEN 20%
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 1994) THEN 12.5%
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1994) THEN 9.5%
        OTHERWISE 0

-- The tables each rate is set out in, annexes א'–ה', are not in the
-- document as the corpus holds it: the supplement is computed from the
-- rate, and the tables' cells are not read.
`why the 1994 Oz agreement's salary tables are not here` MEANS
    `the text is missing` "נספחים א'–ה' להסכם הקיבוצי מיום 31.8.94: טבלאות השכר המשולב"

-- 2.5: 34% of the combined salary, its final rate set by the result of the
-- erosion check of January 1996 under §8 of the agreement of 11.5.93
-- (outside the corpus; its result is the section's input). ¶3–¶5: a
-- negative result is taken off the annex ה' table, a nil result leaves the
-- 34% table, and an erosion updates the table by its rate: the table moves
-- by the result, "בשיעור", relatively (convention amounts.increase).
-- F-oz-1994-a: ¶1 raises the supplement "החל מיום 1.4.96", and ¶6 says
-- that payment by the annex ה' table, once adjusted to the check, applies
-- from 1.1.96. The reading adopted (convention precedence.specific): ¶6,
-- which speaks of the day the table applies from, governs; so does §ב.2
-- of the agreement of 12.9.95, which adds the same rule to this one.
@ref akn:art_2__para_2-5 akn:art_2__para_2-5/p2 akn:art_2__para_2-5/p3 akn:art_2__para_2-5/p4 akn:art_2__para_2-5/p5 akn:art_2__para_2-5/p6
`the 1994 Oz supplement rate before the erosion check` MEANS 34%

`the day §2.5's first paragraph raises the supplement from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 1996
`the day §2.5's last paragraph applies the annex ה' table from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1996

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the annex ה' table of the 1994 Oz agreement applies on` d IF
    d `is on or after` `the day §2.5's last paragraph applies the annex ה' table from`

-- The combined salary with the supplement, as the tables set it out: the
-- combined salary times one and the rate before 1996; from 1.1.96 the
-- annex ה' table, the 34% table moved by the erosion check's result.
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the combined salary` IS A NUMBER @desc §2.1's: as it was to be paid on 1.1.94, תוספת 1993 included, as updated from time to time
      `the erosion result` IS A NUMBER @desc the result of the erosion check of January 1996 under §8 of the agreement of 11.5.93, as a fraction: positive where the teachers' pay was eroded, negative where it gained
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the combined salary with the 1994 Oz supplement on` d `the combined salary` `the erosion result` IS
    IF `the annex ה' table of the 1994 Oz agreement applies on` d
    THEN (`the combined salary` `increased by` `the 1994 Oz supplement rate before the erosion check`) `increased by` `the erosion result`
    ELSE `the combined salary` `increased by` (`the 1994 Oz supplement rate before 1996 on` d)

§§ `3 "תוספת 1993"`

-- ¶1: from 1.1.94 תוספת 1993 is no longer paid on its own line: it is in
-- the combined salary's table. ¶2: §2's supplements are given on the new
-- combined salary, which includes it. (The agreement of 12.9.95, §א.1.3,
-- cancels this section on its signing; its §א.1.1 puts תוספת 1993 and
-- תוספת השהייה in the tables from 1.1.94.)
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3/p1 akn:art_3/p2
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1994 Oz agreement pays תוספת 1993 on its own line on` d IF
    NOT d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1994)

`§2's supplements are given on a combined salary that includes תוספת 1993` MEANS TRUE

§§ `4 השתלמות בית-ספרית`

-- 4.1: from 1.9.94 sections 6, 7, 15, 18 and 29 of the agreement of
-- 11.5.93, and its annexes ב'–ה', are cancelled as far as they concern
-- teaching employees.
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4__para_4-1
`the sections of the agreement of 11.5.93 the 1994 Oz agreement cancels` MEANS LIST 6, 7, 15, 18, 29
`the annexes of the agreement of 11.5.93 the 1994 Oz agreement cancels` MEANS LIST "ב'", "ג'", "ד'", "ה'"

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1994 Oz agreement has cancelled the school in-service sections on` d IF
    d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1994)

-- 4.2: notwithstanding 4.1, the in-service hours the teachers gave during
-- the school year תשנ"ד earn the in-service allowance by the rules of §29
-- of the agreement of 11.5.93 (outside the corpus); ¶2: a parity
-- committee sets the arrangement for giving the allowances (no deadline:
-- convention dates.no-deadline).
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-2
GIVEN `the school year the hours were given in` IS A NUMBER @desc the calendar year it opens in: 1993 for תשנ"ד
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in-service hours earn the allowance under §29 of 11.5.93` `the school year the hours were given in` IF
    `the school year the hours were given in` EQUALS 1993

@ref akn:art_4__para_4-2/p2
`setting the arrangement for the 5754 in-service allowances` MEANS
    PARTY `the parity committee`
    MUST  `set the arrangement for the in-service allowances of 5754`

§§ `5 הכללת רכיבים לפנסיה`

-- ¶1: the employers allocate 0.5% of the teachers' salary determining
-- the pension to buy accrual-pension rights, in each of the agreement's
-- years from 1993 to 1996: 2% for the agreement's period in all. (The
-- agreement of 8.9.98, §10.5, takes its §10 as the full exhaustion of this
-- section.)
@ref akn:art_5 akn:art_5/p1
`the share of the pension salary allocated a year under the 1994 Oz agreement` MEANS 0.5%
`the years the 1994 Oz agreement allocates for accrual-pension rights` MEANS LIST 1993, 1994, 1995, 1996

`the share of the pension salary the 1994 Oz agreement allocates in all` MEANS
    `the share of the pension salary allocated a year under the 1994 Oz agreement` TIMES count `the years the 1994 Oz agreement allocates for accrual-pension rights`

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `1994 Oz agreement action`
DECIDE `allocating for accrual-pension rights in` y IS
    IF elem y `the years the 1994 Oz agreement allocates for accrual-pension rights`
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `allocate half a percent of the pension salary a year for accrual-pension rights`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- ¶2: a joint committee of the Treasury, the Ministry, the local
-- government, the three large cities and the organisation applies to the
-- teachers the recommendations of the Treasury Director-General's
-- committee, set up under the engineers' agreement of 29.4.94, on the pay
-- components not in the salary determining an accrual pension. The
-- recommendations are outside the corpus.
@ref akn:art_5/p2
`why the recommendations on non-pensionable components are not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "המלצות ועדת מנכ\"ל האוצר שהוקמה מכוח ההסכם הקיבוצי מיום 29.4.94 עם הסתדרות המהנדסים, לגבי רכיבי השכר שאינם נכללים במשכורת הקובעת לפנסיה צוברת"

§§ `6 תוספת תגבור הוראה`

-- ¶1: from 1.9.94 a supplement of 106 shekels, "תגבור הוראה" (worth 4% on
-- average in September 1994: a gloss, no rule). It is updated during the
-- agreement's period at the dates and the rates of the cost-of-living
-- increments, and after it at the rates of the wage supplements when they
-- are given and of the cost-of-living increments: each update applies to
-- the amount in force on its day (convention dates.update-in-force), by
-- its rate, relatively (convention amounts.increase).
@ref akn:art_6 akn:art_6/p1
`the teaching-reinforcement supplement of 1.9.94` MEANS 106

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1994 Oz agreement pays the teaching-reinforcement supplement on` d IF
    d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1994)

GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
      `the rates of the updates` IS A LIST OF NUMBER @desc in order: the cost-of-living increments during the period, then the wage supplements and the cost-of-living increments after it
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the teaching-reinforcement supplement updated by` amount `the rates of the updates` IS
    CONSIDER `the rates of the updates`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN amount
    WHEN r FOLLOWED BY rest THEN `the teaching-reinforcement supplement updated by` (amount `increased by` r) rest

-- ¶2: it is the base of the percentage allowances, save תוספת שהייה, and
-- part of the salary for the hour value, the social terms, and the salary
-- determining severance pay and pension; it has its own payslip line.
-- ¶3: it is not among the salary components of the erosion check of §8
-- of the agreement of 11.5.93.
@ref akn:art_6/p2 akn:art_6/p3
DECLARE `what the 1994 teaching-reinforcement supplement may count for` IS ONE OF
    `computing a percentage allowance other than תוספת שהייה`
    `computing תוספת שהייה`
    `computing the hour value`
    `the social terms`
    `the salary determining severance pay`
    `the salary determining the pension`
    `the salary components of the erosion check`

GIVEN p IS A `what the 1994 teaching-reinforcement supplement may count for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the teaching-reinforcement supplement counts for` p IF
        NOT p EQUALS `computing תוספת שהייה`
    AND NOT p EQUALS `the salary components of the erosion check`

`the teaching-reinforcement supplement has its own payslip line` MEANS TRUE

§§ `7 קצובת הבראה`

-- 7.1: from the school year תשנ"ה (1.9.1994: convention dates.school-year)
-- the havraa allowance grows by a day, so that a teacher has, by the years
-- of work in teaching: the first three, 7 days; 4–10, 9; 11–15, 10;
-- 16–19, 11; 20 and more, 12. "3 השנים הראשונות" names the years by their
-- order, so a row is the year the teacher is in (convention
-- thresholds.seniority). The days before תשנ"ה are the agreements' of the
-- eve, outside the corpus.
@ref akn:art_7 akn:art_7__para_7-1 akn:art_7__para_7-1/t1
GIVEN `the year of teaching he is in` IS A NUMBER @desc one in the first year
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the havraa days of the 1994 Oz table for` `the year of teaching he is in` IS
    BRANCH
        IF `the year of teaching he is in` `has reached the row from` 20 THEN 12
        IF `the year of teaching he is in` `has reached the row from` 16 THEN 11
        IF `the year of teaching he is in` `has reached the row from` 11 THEN 10
        IF `the year of teaching he is in` `has reached the row from` 4 THEN 9
        OTHERWISE 7

-- 7.2: from the school year תשנ"ו a teacher with 25 years of seniority in
-- teaching or more has 13 days a year: whole years completed (convention
-- thresholds.seniority), "ומעלה" with 25 in.
@ref akn:art_7__para_7-2
GIVEN `the school year` IS A NUMBER @desc the calendar year it opens in
      `whole years of teaching completed` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the havraa days the 1994 Oz agreement gives in` `the school year` `whole years of teaching completed` IS
    IF `the school year` AT LEAST 1995 AND `whole years of teaching completed` AT LEAST 25
    THEN JUST 13
    ELSE IF `the school year` AT LEAST 1994
         THEN JUST (`the havraa days of the 1994 Oz table for` (`whole years of teaching completed` PLUS 1))
         ELSE NOTHING

§§ `8 מענק יובל`

-- ¶1: from the salary of June 1995, and every year after in the same
-- month (convention dates.salary-month), a teaching employee with
-- accumulated seniority in teaching of 30 years or more — military service
-- included, with the employers and in the formal education institutions
-- (primary schools, junior high, post-primary, colleges and seminars) — is
-- paid a jubilee grant of 60% of the salary determining the pension and
-- severance pay, without the one-time yearly payments, clothing and
-- havraa. Years are whole years completed (convention
-- thresholds.seniority); "ומעלה" with 30 in. (The Oz LaTmura agreement of
-- 14.8.2011, §42, sets 25 years from the salary of June 2012.)
@ref akn:art_8 akn:art_8/p1
`the jubilee seniority section 8 of the 1994 Oz agreement requires` MEANS 30
`the jubilee grant's share of the determining salary under the 1994 Oz agreement` MEANS 60%
`the month the 1994 Oz jubilee grant is paid with` MEANS 6

GIVEN `whole years of accumulated teaching seniority` IS A NUMBER @desc military service included, with the employers and in the formal education institutions
      `the seniority required` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `has the jubilee seniority of` `whole years of accumulated teaching seniority` `the seniority required` IF
    `whole years of accumulated teaching seniority` AT LEAST `the seniority required`

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER @desc the salary month: year and month
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1994 Oz jubilee grant is paid with the salary of` y m IF
    y AT LEAST 1995 AND m EQUALS `the month the 1994 Oz jubilee grant is paid with`

-- ¶3: the grant is paid by the teacher's position share in that year: the
-- average of its months (convention position.yearly), with no cap the
-- section sets (convention position.above-full).
@ref akn:art_8/p3
GIVEN `the determining salary` IS A NUMBER @desc the salary determining the pension and severance pay, without the one-time yearly payments, clothing and havraa
      `the position share that year` IS A NUMBER @desc the average of the year's months
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1994 Oz jubilee grant` `the determining salary` `the position share that year` IS
    `the jubilee grant's share of the determining salary under the 1994 Oz agreement` TIMES `the determining salary` TIMES `the position share that year`

GIVEN `whole years of accumulated teaching seniority` IS A NUMBER
      `the determining salary` IS A NUMBER
      `the position share that year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the jubilee grant section 8 of the 1994 Oz agreement pays` `whole years of accumulated teaching seniority` `the determining salary` `the position share that year` IS
    IF `has the jubilee seniority of` `whole years of accumulated teaching seniority` `the jubilee seniority section 8 of the 1994 Oz agreement requires`
    THEN `the 1994 Oz jubilee grant` `the determining salary` `the position share that year`
    ELSE 0

-- ¶2: a teacher whose seniority already entitled him to the grant in the
-- school year תשנ"ד is paid it with the salary of October 1994.
@ref akn:art_8/p2
`the salary month a teacher entitled in 5754 is paid the grant with` MEANS LIST 1994, 10

§§ `9 גמול ניהול למנהלים גימלאים בפנסיה תקציבית`

-- ¶1: principals who retired before the school year תשנ"ד (1.9.1993) may
-- choose between the management allowance computed on their personal
-- combined salary and the one computed on the combined salary of a
-- certified teacher at the top of the seniority, "by the higher of the
-- two". ¶2: the choice is made within three months of the signing — by
-- 30.11.94, the day included (convention dates.end) — and applies from
-- then on; nothing is paid back for the time before it, and the choice is
-- not changed later.
@ref akn:art_9 akn:art_9/p1 akn:art_9/p2
`the days the 1994 Oz agreement gives a retired principal to choose` MEANS
    DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 11 1994) MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the 1994 Oz agreement was signed on`

GIVEN `retired on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `1994 Oz agreement action`
DECIDE `a retired principal choosing the management allowance's base` `retired on` IS
    IF NOT `retired on` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1993)
    THEN PARTY `the teaching employee`
         MAY   `choose the management allowance's base`
         WITHIN `the days the 1994 Oz agreement gives a retired principal to choose`
    ELSE FULFILLED

GIVEN `chose in time` IS A BOOLEAN
      `on his personal combined salary` IS A NUMBER
      `on a certified teacher's at the top of the seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a retired principal's management allowance from the choice` `chose in time` `on his personal combined salary` `on a certified teacher's at the top of the seniority` IS
    IF `chose in time`
    THEN max `on his personal combined salary` `on a certified teacher's at the top of the seniority`
    ELSE `on his personal combined salary`

`the 1994 Oz agreement pays a retired principal's choice back` MEANS FALSE
`a retired principal may change the choice later` MEANS FALSE

§§ `10–12 גמולים, שעות ופיצול`

-- §10: in addition to §12 of the agreement of 11.5.93, 250 more
-- intermediate allowances in תשנ"ה and 250 more in תשנ"ו: 500 more in all,
-- to the quota of both organisations.
@ref akn:art_10 akn:art_10/p1
`the intermediate allowances the 1994 Oz agreement adds in 5755` MEANS 250
`the intermediate allowances the 1994 Oz agreement adds in 5756` MEANS 250

-- §11: 500 weekly hours for the principals and deputies of the
-- pedagogical centres, from תשנ"ה.
@ref akn:art_11 akn:art_11/p1
`the weekly hours for the pedagogical centres from 5755` MEANS 500

-- §12: a joint committee, to raise the number of teachers entitled to the
-- split-day allowance within the agreed cost (16 million shekels for both
-- organisations), finishes its work by 31.12.94 (the day included:
-- convention dates.end); its recommendations are applied retroactively
-- from 1.9.94.
@ref akn:art_12 akn:art_12/p1 akn:art_12/p2
`the agreed cost of the split-day allowance for both organisations` MEANS 16_000_000

`finishing the split-allowance committee's work` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `finish the split-allowance committee's work`
    WITHIN DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 1994) MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the 1994 Oz agreement was signed on`
    HENCE (PARTY `the employer`
           MUST  `apply the split-allowance committee's recommendations from 1.9.94`)

§§ `13 גמול תואר M.A. ו-PH.D`

-- 13.1: from תשנ"ה (1.9.1994), a teaching employee in the M.A. or the
-- doctor's salary grade who holds a teaching certificate, a teaching
-- licence or a seminar graduate's certificate has a special supplement on
-- his personal combined salary: 5% for an M.A., 10% for a Ph.D.
@ref akn:art_13 akn:art_13__para_13-1 akn:art_13__para_13-1/p2 akn:art_13__para_13-1/p3
DECLARE `the 1994 Oz degree grade` IS ONE OF
    `the M.A. grade`
    `the doctor's grade`
    `another grade`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      g IS A `the 1994 Oz degree grade`
      `holds a teaching certificate, licence or seminar certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1994 Oz degree supplement rate on` d g `holds a teaching certificate, licence or seminar certificate` IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1994) AND `holds a teaching certificate, licence or seminar certificate`
    THEN (CONSIDER g
          WHEN `the M.A. grade` THEN 5%
          WHEN `the doctor's grade` THEN 10%
          WHEN `another grade` THEN 0)
    ELSE 0

-- 13.2: the supplement is part of the salary determining severance pay and
-- the pension.
@ref akn:art_13__para_13-2
`the 1994 Oz degree supplement determines severance pay and the pension` MEANS TRUE

§§ `14 גמול ניהול ופיקוח`

-- 14.1: from 1.9.94 the management allowances of principals and deputies,
-- and the supervision allowances of supervisors under annex ב' of the
-- agreement of 88/90 (outside the corpus), are updated by 2.5%; 14.2: from
-- 1.1.95 by 5% cumulatively — 5% over the allowance of the eve in all, not
-- 2.5% twice. An allowance that is itself a rate grows relatively
-- (convention amounts.increase). 14.3: if the joint committee set up under
-- §11 of the agreement of 11.5.93 sets another rate or arrangement for the
-- management allowance, it takes the place of 14.1–14.2: a fact of the
-- case.
@ref akn:art_14 akn:art_14__para_14-1 akn:art_14__para_14-2 akn:art_14__para_14-3
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1994 Oz update of the management and supervision allowances on` d IS
    BRANCH
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1995) THEN 5%
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1994) THEN 2.5%
        OTHERWISE 0

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the allowance on the eve` IS A NUMBER
      `the committee of §11 of 11.5.93 set another arrangement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `a management or supervision allowance under the 1994 Oz agreement on` d `the allowance on the eve` `the committee of §11 of 11.5.93 set another arrangement` IS
    IF `the committee of §11 of 11.5.93 set another arrangement`
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE JUST (`the allowance on the eve` `increased by` (`the 1994 Oz update of the management and supervision allowances on` d))

§§ `15–17 השתלמות וועדת הסמינרים`

-- §15: the grants of in-service hours grow beyond the existing quota by
-- 3,000 weekly hours: 1,000 from 1.9.94, 1,000 more from 1.9.95 and 1,000
-- more from 1.9.96; the existing criteria for dividing them stand.
@ref akn:art_15 akn:art_15__para_15-1 akn:art_15__para_15-1/p2 akn:art_15__para_15-1/p3 akn:art_15__para_15-1/p4 akn:art_15__para_15-2
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the in-service weekly hours the 1994 Oz agreement adds by` d IS
    BRANCH
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1996) THEN 3000
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1995) THEN 2000
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1994) THEN 1000
        OTHERWISE 0

`the criteria for dividing the in-service grants change under the 1994 Oz agreement` MEANS FALSE

-- §16 (§14 of the agreement of 1984): the sums transferred to the teachers'
-- organisations for their members' in-service training grow to 2 million
-- shekels, transferred by the plans submitted to the Ministry and divided
-- by the organisations' relative size.
@ref akn:art_16 akn:art_16/p1 akn:art_16/p2
`the in-service training sum for the organisations under the 1994 Oz agreement` MEANS 2_000_000

GIVEN `the organisation's members` IS A NUMBER, `both organisations' members` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `an organisation's share of the in-service training sum` `the organisation's members` `both organisations' members` IS
    `the in-service training sum for the organisations under the 1994 Oz agreement` TIMES `the organisation's members` DIVIDED BY `both organisations' members`

`transferring the in-service training sums` MEANS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `transfer the in-service training sums to the organisations`

-- §17: the joint committee on the terms of the teachers in seminars and
-- colleges ends its work and publishes its conclusions by the end of 1994;
-- the parties carry them out if all of them agree to them, and only on an
-- agreed cost arrangement.
@ref akn:art_17 akn:art_17/p1
`publishing the colleges committee's conclusions` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `publish the colleges committee's conclusions`
    WITHIN DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 1994) MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the 1994 Oz agreement was signed on`

GIVEN `all the parties agreed to the conclusions` IS A BOOLEAN, `the cost was agreed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `1994 Oz agreement action`
DECIDE `carrying out the colleges committee's conclusions` `all the parties agreed to the conclusions` `the cost was agreed` IS
    IF `all the parties agreed to the conclusions` AND `the cost was agreed`
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `carry out the colleges committee's conclusions`
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `18 גימלאים`

-- 18.1: the agreement applies to the pensioners on a budgetary pension.
@ref akn:art_18 akn:art_18__para_18-1
`the 1994 Oz agreement applies to budgetary pensioners` MEANS TRUE

-- 18.2: pensioners who retired during 1993 have the payments made to them
-- for redeemed leave, sick-leave compensation and the statutory retirement
-- grant updated by 4.5% (convention amounts.increase); ¶2: the difference
-- is paid with the salary of October 1994.
@ref akn:art_18__para_18-2 akn:art_18__para_18-2/p2
`the update of the 1993 retirees' payments` MEANS 4.5%

GIVEN `retired in` IS A NUMBER @desc the calendar year
      `the payment made` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1993 retiree's difference under the 1994 Oz agreement` `retired in` `the payment made` IS
    IF `retired in` EQUALS 1993
    THEN (`the payment made` `increased by` `the update of the 1993 retirees' payments`) MINUS `the payment made`
    ELSE 0

`paying the 1993 retirees their difference` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the 1993 retirees their difference`
    WITHIN DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 10 1994) MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the 1994 Oz agreement was signed on`

-- 18.3: a joint committee of the wages commissioner, the Centre of Local
-- Government, the Histadrut HaMorim's secretary-general and the
-- organisation's chair examines the erosion of the budgetary pensions (set
-- up after the erosion check of the State's pensioners): a committee and
-- its work, no rule of entitlement.
@ref akn:art_18__para_18-3
`the 1994 Oz agreement sets up a committee on the erosion of budgetary pensions` MEANS TRUE

§§ `19 חסכון בשנת שבתון`

-- ¶1: a teacher in a sabbatical year employed part time may save in the
-- shortened fund (מישור); the employers transfer their share at 7.5% of
-- his salary against his 2.5%. ¶2: subject to the approvals of the income
-- tax and capital market divisions of the Treasury, where needed.
@ref akn:art_19 akn:art_19/p1 akn:art_19/p2
`the employers' share in the shortened fund in a sabbatical` MEANS 7.5%
`the teacher's share in the shortened fund in a sabbatical` MEANS 2.5%

GIVEN `in a sabbatical year` IS A BOOLEAN
      `employed part time` IS A BOOLEAN
      `chose to save` IS A BOOLEAN
      `approved where approval is needed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `1994 Oz agreement action`
DECIDE `transferring to the shortened fund in a sabbatical` `in a sabbatical year` `employed part time` `chose to save` `approved where approval is needed` IS
    IF `in a sabbatical year` AND `employed part time` AND `chose to save` AND `approved where approval is needed`
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `transfer the employers' share to the shortened fund`
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `20 הגנה מפני אינפלציה`

-- 20.1: the amounts in the new tables are updated from 1.1.94 at the
-- dates and rates of the cost-of-living increments, by the cost-of-living
-- agreement as it applies from time to time (an input: the increments).
@ref akn:art_20 akn:art_20__para_20-1
GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER, `the cost-of-living increments since 1.1.94` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a 1994 Oz table amount updated by the cost of living` amount `the cost-of-living increments since 1.1.94` IS
    `the teaching-reinforcement supplement updated by` amount `the cost-of-living increments since 1.1.94`

-- 20.2: if the consumer price index rises in 1996 above 11% for the year
-- (strictly: convention thresholds.above), the teachers are paid 0.15% of
-- the new combined salary for each percent of inflation above 11%, up to a
-- ceiling of 15%: whole percents (convention thresholds.per-n), and 15 is
-- the most counted, in (an exception to convention thresholds.until: a
-- ceiling, not a threshold). ¶2: paid by updating the salary table in the
-- salary of January 1997, from 1.9.96.
@ref akn:art_20__para_20-2 akn:art_20__para_20-2/p2
`the inflation the 1994 Oz agreement compensates above` MEANS 11%
`the inflation the 1994 Oz agreement compensates up to` MEANS 15%
`the compensation for each percent of inflation` MEANS 0.15%

GIVEN `the CPI's rise in 1996` IS A NUMBER @desc as a fraction
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1994 Oz inflation compensation rate for` `the CPI's rise in 1996` IS
    IF `the CPI's rise in 1996` `is above` `the inflation the 1994 Oz agreement compensates above`
    THEN `the compensation for each percent of inflation` TIMES
             `whole blocks of` (1%) `in` (min `the CPI's rise in 1996` `the inflation the 1994 Oz agreement compensates up to` MINUS `the inflation the 1994 Oz agreement compensates above`)
    ELSE 0

`the 1994 Oz inflation compensation applies from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1996
`the salary month the 1994 Oz inflation compensation is paid with` MEANS LIST 1997, 1

§§ `21 חוזים אישיים`

-- ¶1: the employers may employ 100 teaching employees in the school year
-- תשנ"ה on special contracts; ¶11: in תשנ"ו they employ 100 more in the
-- arrangement — "עוד", on top of תשנ"ה's (convention reading.as-printed).
-- (The agreement of 8.9.98, §11, keeps this section for its own period;
-- the Oz LaTmura agreement of 14.8.2011, §53, raises the number to 1,500 a
-- year from תשע"ב.)
@ref akn:art_21 akn:art_21/p1 akn:art_21/p11
GIVEN `the school year` IS A NUMBER @desc the calendar year it opens in
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the special contracts §21 of the 1994 Oz agreement allows in` `the school year` IS
    BRANCH
        IF `the school year` EQUALS 1995 THEN 200
        IF `the school year` EQUALS 1994 THEN 100
        OTHERWISE 0

-- ¶2–¶5: the special contract's text is uniform, drafted by the wages
-- commissioner's unit at the Treasury (as usual in the State service,
-- fitted to the teaching professions), annexed to the collective
-- agreement, handed to every owner, and passed to the organisation to
-- review; the Ministry sees that the owners have the teachers employed on
-- it sign the uniform text. No deadline (convention dates.no-deadline).
@ref akn:art_21/p2 akn:art_21/p3 akn:art_21/p4 akn:art_21/p5
`drafting the uniform special contract` MEANS
    PARTY `the wages commissioner at the Treasury`
    MUST  `draft the uniform special contract`
    HENCE (PARTY `the wages commissioner at the Treasury`
           MUST  `hand the special contract's text to every owner`
           HENCE (PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
                  MUST  `have the owners' special-contract teachers sign the uniform text`))

`passing the special contract's text to the organisation` MEANS
    PARTY `the wages commissioner at the Treasury`
    MUST  `pass the special contract's text to the organisation`

`the special contract's text is annexed to the collective agreement` MEANS TRUE

-- ¶6–¶10: the arrangement runs in the confrontation-line localities, the
-- localities of national priority area א', the localities of targeted
-- treatment and the rehabilitation neighbourhoods: a closed list
-- (convention reading.closed-list).
@ref akn:art_21/p6 akn:art_21/p7 akn:art_21/p8 akn:art_21/p9 akn:art_21/p10
DECLARE `area of the 1994 Oz special contracts` IS ONE OF
    `a confrontation-line locality`
    `a locality of national priority area א'`
    `a locality of targeted treatment`
    `a rehabilitation neighbourhood`
    `another place`

GIVEN a IS AN `area of the 1994 Oz special contracts`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§21 of the 1994 Oz agreement runs in` a IF
    NOT a EQUALS `another place`

-- ¶12: at the end of each year the names of all the teachers employed in
-- the arrangement are sent to the organisation; ¶13: during each year the
-- organisation is passed data on the programme's success, the pupils'
-- achievements and the like. The text names no one to send them; the
-- employers employ the teachers (¶1), so the duty is theirs.
@ref akn:art_21/p12 akn:art_21/p13
`sending the names of the teachers on special contracts` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `send the organisation the names of the teachers on special contracts`

`passing data on the special contracts' success` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pass the organisation data on the special contracts' success`

§§ `22 תחולת ההסכם`

-- (א): this agreement and the agreement of 11.5.93, completing each other,
-- apply to all the teaching employees in the post-primary schools, the
-- seminars and the colleges in Israel. (ב): the State supervises and acts
-- to apply the agreement to the teachers of the "owners" the Ministry of
-- Education and the Ministry of Labour supervise.
@ref akn:art_22 akn:art_22__para_a
GIVEN `teaches in a post-primary school, a seminar or a college` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1994 Oz agreement applies to a teaching employee who` `teaches in a post-primary school, a seminar or a college` IF
    `teaches in a post-primary school, a seminar or a college`

@ref akn:art_22__para_b
`applying the 1994 agreement to the owners' teachers` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `act to apply the 1994 agreement to the owners' teaching employees`

§§ `23 הארכת תוקף ההסכם הקיבוצי`

-- The agreement of 11.5.93 is extended to 31.12.96 or to the end of the
-- engineers' agreement of 29.4.94, the later of the two: "its extended
-- period".
@ref akn:art_23 akn:art_23/p1
GIVEN `the engineers' agreement ends on` IS A DATE @desc the engineers' agreement of 29.4.94 is outside the corpus
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the extended period of the agreement of 11.5.93 ends on` `the engineers' agreement ends on` IS
    IF `the engineers' agreement ends on` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 1996)
    THEN `the engineers' agreement ends on`
    ELSE DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 1996

§§ `24–26 הפרשים, שבתון והסתדרות המורים`

-- §24: the differences the agreement gives are paid with the salary of
-- October 1994, paid in November 1994 (convention dates.salary-month: the
-- salary month itself).
@ref akn:art_24 akn:art_24/p1
`paying the differences of the 1994 agreement` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the differences of the 1994 agreement`
    WITHIN DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 10 1994) MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the 1994 Oz agreement was signed on`

-- §25: for the avoidance of doubt, it applies to teachers in a sabbatical
-- year too.
@ref akn:art_25 akn:art_25/p1
`the 1994 Oz agreement applies in a sabbatical year` MEANS TRUE

-- 26.1: any agreement between the employers and Histadrut HaMorim is
-- within this agreement's cost; 26.2: if it changes terms or gives
-- supplements or payments beyond that cost, the changes apply here
-- accordingly. (The agreement of 12.9.95 is made under this section.)
@ref akn:art_26 akn:art_26__para_26-1 akn:art_26__para_26-2
GIVEN `Histadrut HaMorim's agreement goes beyond this agreement's cost` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Histadrut HaMorim's changes apply under the 1994 Oz agreement` `Histadrut HaMorim's agreement goes beyond this agreement's cost` IF
    `Histadrut HaMorim's agreement goes beyond this agreement's cost`

§§ `27–28 מיצוי תביעות ושקט תעשייתי`

-- 27.1: the agreement exhausts all the parties' claims, national and
-- local, on what it settles, for the extended period of the agreement of
-- 11.5.93 (§23) — those under its §34.ג on the engineers' supplements of
-- 29.4.94 among them — subject to the letter of 1.9.94, which names the
-- matters it does not exhaust (below).
@ref akn:art_27 akn:art_27__para_27-1
GIVEN `the matter` IS A STRING, d IS A DATE, `the extended period ends on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1994 Oz agreement exhausts the claims on` `the matter` d `the extended period ends on` IF
        NOT elem `the matter` `the matters the 1994 Oz agreement does not exhaust`
    AND d `is on or before` `the extended period ends on`

-- 27.2: the terms of the agreement of 11.5.93 it does not change, expressly
-- or by implication, stand in its period; 27.3: if the value of the
-- engineers' agreement changes while this one is in force, the
-- supplements are given to the teachers.
@ref akn:art_27__para_27-2 akn:art_27__para_27-3
`the terms of 11.5.93 the 1994 Oz agreement does not change stand` MEANS TRUE

GIVEN `the engineers' agreement's value changed in the period` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the engineers' change is given to the teachers under §27.3` `the engineers' agreement's value changed in the period` IF
    `the engineers' agreement's value changed in the period`

-- 28.1: the labour disputes declared or notified on the matters it
-- settles are void on its signing; 28.2: during the agreement of 11.5.93's
-- period no side strikes or locks out, in full or in part, nor harms the
-- work in an organised way, over those matters.
@ref akn:art_28 akn:art_28__para_28-1
`the labour disputes on the 1994 Oz agreement's matters stand` MEANS FALSE

@ref akn:art_28__para_28-2
`industrial peace under the 1994 Oz agreement` MEANS
    PARTY `the secondary teachers' organisation`
    SHANT `strike or lock out over a matter the 1994 agreement settled`

